        <activityName xml:lang="en">Insulated gate bipolar transistor, electric vehicle application</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Insulated gate bipolar transistor, electric vehicle application
This dataset describes the production of an insulated gate bipolar transistor (IGBT) used in the power electronics of electric vehicles. It is based on the direct inspection of a commercial device.;
UUID: acba1dd1-2c49-3467-8a40-32d2f410cf05
The dataset takes as input the various electronic components required to build the transistor and includes the components" production efforts. The dataset returns the assembled device and production waste as a by-product.
Location: Unspecified
Technology: Unspecified
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 3440000 kg
Sampling: Direct inspection of a typical device of common technology. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_acba1dd1-2c49-3467-8a40-32d2f410cf05.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
